{"version":1,"content":"<p>關鍵稀土釔（yttrium）全球出口停滯導致供應嚴重短缺，《金融時報》引述消息指日本儲備僅剩數月。</p><p>日本經濟產業省官員周三（21日）向法新社證實，釔出口減少並面臨供需危機，正與美歐協調應對。</p><p>中國外交部回應稱，依法對日實施出口管制。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T13:02:00.972256+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":116,"images":0,"source":"明報 國際","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T12:30:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T04:57:44.518854+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T12:57:49.806674+00:00","content_hash":"5ba04525a02fe48d1cf8ff9fe0ac2bcbce88b545574e9cef51d3c2b4cb76addf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}